-- expect-refusal: is not monotone in that order
-- a value of the wrong direction: a difference taken from the value turns a min the wrong way, so a better cost would conclude a worse one
edb(aosr_e).
aosr_e(a, b, 2, 9).
pareto aosr_dir(A, B, min C, min T).
aosr_dir(A, B, C, T) :- aosr_e(A, B, C, T).
aosr_dir(A, C, C1, T1) :- aosr_dir(A, B, C0, T0), aosr_e(B, C, C2, T2), C1 is 100 - C0, T1 is T0 + T2.
